  "question": {
    "text": "The number of permutations, of the digits <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>7</mn></math> without repetition, which neither contain the string <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>153</mn></math> nor the string <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2467</mn></math>, is _______ .",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "4898",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p>The number&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p><p>Now total numbers of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math>&nbsp;digit number will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn><mo>!</mo></math>&nbsp;without repetition,</p><p>Now total&nbsp;numbers which contain string&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>154</mn></math>&nbsp;will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>!</mo></math></p><p>Total numbers which contain string&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2367</mn></math>&nbsp;will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>!</mo></math></p><p>And number which contain both string&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2367</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>154</mn></math>&nbsp;will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>So, total number which does not contain string&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>154</mn></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2367</mn></math>&nbsp;will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>5040</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>120</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>5040</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>142</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4898</mn></math></p><p>Hence this is the required answer.</p></blockquote>",
    "image": null
  },
